SUMMARY:Free Beautiful Writing - Calligraphy Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Led by Tricia Goginsky\, Artist Facilitator \nCalligraphy means “beautiful writing” and it is usually thought of as a traditional art form that requires precision and a lot of time to master. However\, it can also be a playful and expressive personal practice! \nIn this workshop\, we will use simple tools to learn the basic calligraphy strokes and how to turn those strokes into beautiful lettering. After a little practice\, we’ll make posters inspired by words that are meaningful to us. This is a non-traditional and fun way to start using modern calligraphy to express your ideas. No previous experience is necessary! RSVP required \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/free-beautiful-writing-calligraphy-workshop/
LOCATION:Heidi Gallery at JSDD\, 310 Eisenhower Parkway\, Livingston\, NJ\, 07039\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="Heidi Gallery at JSDD":MAILTO:jmoss@jsdd.org
END:VEVENT
